 124                 	; 12400 Extended Memory Move PR0 function, LIGHTS PR0 function, Field 1 Vectors
 125                 	; 12600 Flash ROM programming
 126                 	; 13000 SBC6120-RC RAM disk I/O, DS1221 battery test
 127                 	; 13200 to 17377 are used by command tables, error messages and help text
 128                 	; 17400 to 17777 are used as a temporary buffer for disk I/O
 129                 	
 130                 	; FIELD 2
 131                 	; Page	Usage
 132                 	; -----	----------------------------------------------------------------------
 133                 	; 20000	Field 2 variables, zero page utility functions
 134                 	; 20200	Persistent settings support
 135                 	; 20400	Extension ROM management, field 2 vectors
 136                 	; 20600	Disassembler commands X, XP and TR.  Disassembler code.
 137                 	; 21200	to 21277 Disassembler code
 138                 	; 21400	to 22377 Disassembler tables
 139                 	; 22400 to 27600 are currently free

